  "description": {
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1,
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Why"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Checkout today is a saga of queue messages between shop-api and shop-worker: reserve stock, authorize the card, create the order, send the confirmation. Each step retries on its own, and when one step gives up the compensations are best effort. Support sees about 40 orders a week with a captured payment and no order, or an order with released stock."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "A durable workflow engine keeps the state of each checkout, retries each activity with its own policy, and runs the compensations in order when a step fails for good."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Scope"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "bulletList",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "A pure workflow function "
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "checkoutWorkflow(cart)",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "code"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": " in "
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "@acme/shop-shared",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "code"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": ", with no I/O of its own."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Activities in shop-worker: "
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "reserveStock",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "code"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": ", "
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "authorizePayment",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "code"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": ", "
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "createOrder",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "code"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": ", "
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "sendConfirmation",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "code"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": " and their compensations."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "A gate in "
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "POST /checkout",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "code"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": " that sends a share of carts to the new path, by the "
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "checkout_v2_percent",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "code"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": " flag."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Replay tests that run recorded histories against every new build of the workflow."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Out of scope"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "bulletList",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Moving cart storage to PostgreSQL (SHOP-3463)."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Changes to the payments provider or its webhooks."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Source"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Spike results in SHOP-3446, design in "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Checkout V2 :: Architecture",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "link",
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://acme.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SHOP/pages/7340022"
         }
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "."
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
